{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"subquestions\": [\n    \"FOG的临床表型与分层：如何区分OFF-state FOG、ON-state FOG、levodopa-resistant FOG、levodopa-induced FOG，以及转弯、启动、狭窄通道、双任务和情绪压力诱发的FOG？不同表型是否对应不同的STN神经活动模式？\",\n    \"FOG易感性与实际发作的区别：STN活动变化是长期存在的freezer易感性标志，还是发作前数秒至数百毫秒出现的动态神经事件？发作前、发作中、发作终止和正常行走期间的信号是否不同？\",\n    \"STN局部神经活动的哪些指标与FOG相关：单神经元放电率、放电规律性、bursting、局部场电位功率、beta burst持续时间、神经熵以及非周期性神经活动，哪一种具有最稳定的关联？\",\n    \"不同频段的作用是否相互矛盾：theta、alpha、低beta、高beta和gamma活动分别与FOG的易感性、发作启动、持续时间及严重程度有什么关系？beta功率、beta burst持续时间和beta同步是否应被视为不同的生理变量？\",\n    \"STN活动的时空组织：背侧与腹侧STN、运动区与联合区、左右STN之间是否存在不同的FOG相关信号？这些差异能否解释不同研究报告的beta升高、降低或无变化？\",\n    \"STN与皮质网络的关系：M1、PMC、SMA、前额叶和顶叶与STN之间的theta/beta coherence、相位同步、phase-amplitude coupling及有效连接如何变化？FOG是否主要表现为网络协调失效而不是STN局部功率异常？\",\n    \"认知与情绪因素如何影响STN活动：执行功能、注意资源竞争、双任务负荷、焦虑、恐惧和动作冲突是否通过皮质-STN hyperdirect pathway改变theta或beta活动，并诱发FOG？\",\n    \"多巴胺状态的调节作用：左旋多巴是否改变STN活动与FOG的关系？不同频段是否具有不同的药物敏感性？药物改善FOG是否伴随STN信号恢复，还是二者可以解离？\",\n    \"STN与其他基底节和脑干结构的关系：STN-SNr、STN-GPi、STN-PPN、mesencephalic locomotor region、cuneiform nucleus、丘脑、小脑及脊髓运动网络如何参与FOG？STN是主要病理发生节点，还是更大运动网络中的调节节点？\",\n    \"STN-DBS对FOG的因果作用：刺激STN是否真正减少FOG，还是仅改善其他运动症状而间接影响步态？为什么有些患者FOG改善，有些无变化，另一些患者出现新发或加重的FOG？\",\n    \"刺激参数如何改变FOG：高频与低频刺激、60/80/130 Hz、振幅、电压、脉宽、总电能、单侧与双侧刺激、连续与自适应刺激是否具有不同作用？是否存在患者特异性的最佳频率？\",\n    \"刺激位置和纤维束募集如何解释疗效差异：电极接触点、背腹侧位置、方向性刺激、volume of tissue activated、hyperdirect fibers及邻近SNr、PPN或其他步态通路的电流扩散是否比STN局部神经元活动更能预测疗效？\",\n    \"不同测量手段和研究设计如何影响结论：微电极单神经元记录、multi-unit recording、LFP、ECoG、EEG、EMG、fMRI、PET、DTI及计算模型分别能回答什么问题？静息态、踏步、自由行走、真实FOG发作和虚拟现实任务是否产生不可直接比较的结果？\",\n    \"FOG测量和结局定义是否造成研究冲突：FOG-Q、NFOG-Q、FOG assessment course、实际冻结次数、冻结持续时间、freezing index、步态变异性、可穿戴设备和视频判定之间是否存在系统性差异？如何排除自主停步、转弯减速和运动伪迹？\",\n    \"动物与计算模型能否检验机制：MPTP非人灵长类、6-OHDA动物、α-synuclein模型是否真正复现FOG，而不只是一般性运动迟缓？基底节-脑干-中央模式发生器模型能否产生可验证的FOG样动力学？\"\n  ],\n  \"queries\": [\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(TITLE:\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR ABSTRACT:\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR TITLE:FOG OR ABSTRACT:FOG OR TITLE:\\\"gait freezing\\\" OR ABSTRACT:\\\"gait freezing\\\") AND (TITLE:\\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR ABSTRACT:\\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR TITLE:STN OR ABSTRACT:STN) AND (TITLE:Parkinson OR ABSTRACT:Parkinson) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"核心检索式，覆盖PD、FOG和STN直接交叉研究，作为最重要的高召回基线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG OR \\\"gait freezing\\\") AND (\\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR STN) AND (\\\"local field potential\\\" OR LFP OR electrophysiology OR \\\"intracranial recording\\\" OR \\\"chronic sensing\\\" OR neural recording) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"直接寻找人体STN-LFP研究，包括术中、术后外接记录、慢性感知设备及自由行走研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG OR \\\"gait freezing\\\") AND (\\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR STN) AND (\\\"single unit\\\" OR \\\"single-unit\\\" OR multiunit OR \\\"multi-unit\\\" OR \\\"microelectrode recording\\\" OR spiking OR \\\"neuronal firing\\\" OR \\\"firing rate\\\" OR bursting) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"专门覆盖微电极记录、单神经元、多单位放电及放电模式，避免检索只偏向LFP研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (beta OR \\\"low beta\\\" OR \\\"high beta\\\" OR theta OR alpha OR gamma OR oscillation OR oscillations OR \\\"spectral power\\\" OR synchrony) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"比较不同频段与FOG的关联，尤其检查beta升高、theta升高及beta降低等相反结果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (\\\"beta burst\\\" OR \\\"beta bursts\\\" OR \\\"burst duration\\\" OR \\\"burst amplitude\\\" OR entropy OR \\\"neural entropy\\\" OR \\\"sample entropy\\\" OR \\\"phase amplitude coupling\\\" OR \\\"phase-amplitude coupling\\\" OR \\\"cross-frequency coupling\\\" OR \\\"aperiodic activity\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"覆盖超越平均频段功率的动态指标，检验beta burst、熵、跨频耦合是否比平均功率更有解释力。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG OR \\\"gait freezing\\\") AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (\\\"gait initiation\\\" OR \\\"step initiation\\\" OR \\\"gait cycle\\\" OR \\\"step cycle\\\" OR \\\"gait phase\\\" OR \\\"freezing onset\\\" OR \\\"freezing episode\\\" OR prefreezing OR \\\"pre-freezing\\\" OR turning OR \\\"turn-induced\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"研究FOG发作的时间过程、启动阶段、转弯阶段及步态周期锁定的神经变化，区分发作前预测信号与发作中信号。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (\\\"cortico-subthalamic\\\" OR \\\"cortico-STN\\\" OR \\\"cortical-subthalamic\\\" OR coherence OR decoupling OR connectivity OR synchronization OR \\\"phase locking\\\" OR \\\"phase amplitude coupling\\\") AND (EEG OR ECoG OR electrocorticography OR \\\"intracranial EEG\\\" OR cortical) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索皮质-STN网络、ECoG-LFP同步、功能解耦和跨频耦合研究，特别关注FOG是否源于网络协调失效。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR \\\"basal ganglia\\\") AND (\\\"dual task\\\" OR \\\"cognitive load\\\" OR \\\"executive function\\\" OR \\\"response conflict\\\" OR \\\"motor inhibition\\\" OR anxiety OR stress OR emotion OR \\\"virtual reality\\\" OR obstacle OR doorway OR turning) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"覆盖认知负荷、情绪、执行控制和环境触发因素，检验认知-情绪机制及其对STN活动的调节。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (levodopa OR dopamine OR dopaminergic OR \\\"medication ON\\\" OR \\\"medication OFF\\\" OR \\\"ON state\\\" OR \\\"OFF state\\\" OR \\\"levodopa resistant\\\" OR \\\"levodopa responsive\\\" OR \\\"dopamine resistant\\\" OR \\\"dopamine responsive\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"比较药物ON/OFF、左旋多巴敏感性和药物抵抗型FOG，检验多巴胺状态是否改变STN活动与FOG的关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (\\\"dorsal STN\\\" OR \\\"ventral STN\\\" OR \\\"motor STN\\\" OR \\\"associative STN\\\" OR \\\"limbic STN\\\" OR somatotopy OR topography OR localization OR laterality OR \\\"hemispheric asymmetry\\\" OR \\\"subthalamic subregion\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索STN内部功能分区、背腹侧差异和半球侧化，寻找空间定位对冲突结果的解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (\\\"STN-DBS\\\" OR \\\"subthalamic stimulation\\\" OR \\\"deep brain stimulation\\\") AND (frequency OR \\\"low frequency\\\" OR \\\"high frequency\\\" OR \\\"60 Hz\\\" OR \\\"80 Hz\\\" OR \\\"130 Hz\\\" OR amplitude OR voltage OR \\\"pulse width\\\" OR \\\"total electrical energy\\\" OR TEED OR interleaving OR \\\"variable frequency\\\" OR \\\"burst stimulation\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"系统检索STN-DBS参数与FOG关系，覆盖频率、振幅、脉宽、能量及变频策略。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (\\\"STN-DBS\\\" OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus stimulation\\\") AND (randomized OR randomised OR crossover OR \\\"double blind\\\" OR \\\"controlled trial\\\" OR \\\"clinical trial\\\" OR prospective OR longitudinal OR \\\"long-term follow-up\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"集中寻找临床干预证据，优先发现随机、交叉、双盲和前瞻性研究，以区分观察性关联与因果效应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (\\\"STN-DBS\\\" OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus stimulation\\\") AND (tractography OR \\\"diffusion tensor imaging\\\" OR DTI OR \\\"volume of tissue activated\\\" OR VTA OR \\\"lead location\\\" OR \\\"electrode location\\\" OR \\\"directional stimulation\\\" OR connectome OR \\\"fiber pathway\\\" OR \\\"stimulation field\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索电极定位、方向性刺激、VTA和纤维束连接，判断疗效是否由邻近步态通路募集而非STN局部活动决定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR \\\"basal ganglia\\\") AND (SNr OR \\\"substantia nigra pars reticulata\\\" OR \\\"substantia nigra\\\" OR PPN OR \\\"pedunculopontine nucleus\\\" OR MLR OR \\\"mesencephalic locomotor region\\\" OR \\\"cuneiform nucleus\\\" OR GPi OR GPe OR cerebellum OR \\\"supplementary motor area\\\" OR SMA OR thalamus) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"扩展到相邻脑区和运动网络，覆盖SNr、PPN、MLR、楔形核、小脑及其他基底节结构。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (Parkinson OR parkinsonism) AND (fMRI OR \\\"functional MRI\\\" OR PET OR \\\"FDG PET\\\" OR SPECT OR MRI OR DTI OR \\\"resting state\\\" OR \\\"functional connectivity\\\" OR \\\"effective connectivity\\\" OR \\\"dynamic causal modeling\\\" OR \\\"spectral dynamic causal modeling\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索功能影像、代谢影像、结构连接和有效连接研究，评估FOG涉及的皮质-基底节-脑干网络。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR \\\"gait freezing\\\" OR \\\"freezing-like behavior\\\" OR \\\"freezing like\\\" OR \\\"gait arrest\\\" OR locomotion OR \\\"locomotor deficit\\\") AND (MPTP OR \\\"6-OHDA\\\" OR \\\"6-hydroxydopamine\\\" OR \\\"alpha-synuclein\\\" OR A53T OR macaque OR monkey OR primate OR rodent OR rat OR mouse OR \\\"animal model\\\") AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR SNr OR \\\"substantia nigra\\\" OR PPN) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"寻找动物模型中的STN放电、振荡和步态异常，重点区分真正的FOG样发作与一般运动迟缓或运动协调障碍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG OR \\\"gait freezing\\\") AND (computational OR neurocomputational OR \\\"computational model\\\" OR \\\"network model\\\" OR \\\"basal ganglia model\\\" OR \\\"central pattern generator\\\" OR CPG OR simulation OR \\\"dynamical systems\\\" OR \\\"dynamic causal model\\\" OR \\\"susceptible excited refractory\\\") AND (Parkinson OR STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR \\\"basal ganglia\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索计算神经科学和基底节-脑干-脊髓网络模型，寻找能够产生FOG样行为并区分竞争机制的模型。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (\\\"adaptive deep brain stimulation\\\" OR aDBS OR \\\"closed-loop stimulation\\\" OR \\\"closed loop\\\" OR \\\"on-demand stimulation\\\" OR \\\"beta burst-driven\\\" OR \\\"neural biomarker\\\" OR prediction OR \\\"machine learning\\\" OR classifier) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR LFP OR \\\"local field potential\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索闭环刺激、实时预测和个体化神经标志物研究，判断哪些STN指标具有实际预测和干预价值。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR Parkinson) AND (\\\"freezing index\\\" OR \\\"inertial measurement unit\\\" OR IMU OR wearable OR accelerometry OR kinematics OR EMG OR electromyography OR \\\"step time\\\" OR \\\"step length\\\" OR \\\"gait variability\\\" OR \\\"turning duration\\\" OR \\\"freezing of gait questionnaire\\\" OR NFOG-Q OR FOG-Q) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"检索客观步态测量、可穿戴设备、肌电及临床量表，分析不同FOG结局指标造成的研究异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG OR \\\"gait deterioration\\\") AND (\\\"STN-DBS\\\" OR \\\"deep brain stimulation\\\" OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (worsening OR \\\"induced freezing\\\" OR \\\"stimulation-induced\\\" OR postoperative OR \\\"de novo freezing\\\" OR \\\"axial worsening\\\" OR \\\"residual freezing\\\" OR adverse OR deterioration) AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"专门寻找反常和负面干预结果，包括术后FOG加重、刺激诱发FOG、持续性FOG及轴性症状恶化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\" OR DBS OR \\\"deep brain stimulation\\\") AND (review OR \\\"systematic review\\\" OR meta-analysis OR metaanalysis OR \\\"network meta-analysis\\\" OR \\\"scoping review\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"寻找综述、系统综述和荟萃分析，建立证据全景，并比较不同分析纳入标准和结局定义。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"q\": \"(\\\"freezing of gait\\\" OR FOG) AND (STN OR \\\"subthalamic nucleus\\\") AND (\\\"no difference\\\" OR unchanged OR \\\"not associated\\\" OR \\\"no significant\\\" OR null OR negative OR \\\"reduced beta\\\" OR \\\"decreased beta\\\" OR \\\"lower beta\\\" OR \\\"decreased theta\\\" OR \\\"failed to improve\\\" OR \\\"no improvement\\\") AND PUB_YEAR:[2000 TO 2026]\",\n      \"why\": \"主动寻找与主流病理性beta升高假说相反的证据，包括STN功率不变、beta降低、theta方向不一致以及刺激无效的研究。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"must_read\": [\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"21777828\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/S1474-4422(11)70143-0\",\n      \"title\": \"Freezing of gait: moving forward on a mysterious clinical phenomenon\",\n      \"why\": \"FOG领域的基础综述，理解FOG的定义、诱发条件、表型及多因素病理机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"30153383\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1002/mds.27417\",\n      \"title\": \"Evidence for subtypes of freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"直接支持FOG存在认知、情绪和运动相关亚型，是解释不同STN研究结果不一致的重要基础。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"31647540\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awz314\",\n      \"title\": \"Freezing of gait: understanding the complexity of an enigmatic phenomenon\",\n      \"why\": \"系统梳理皮质、基底节、脑干及认知网络机制，适合建立竞争性机制框架。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"24361601\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2013.12.005\",\n      \"title\": \"High beta activity in the subthalamic nucleus and freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"STN高beta与FOG关系的早期关键证据，用于检验beta病理活动假说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"28890315\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2017.09.002\",\n      \"title\": \"Subthalamic neural entropy is a feature of freezing of gait in freely moving people with Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"自由行走条件下的STN神经记录，提供神经熵和动态活动指标，挑战仅用平均beta功率解释FOG的做法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"30100532\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2018.09.004\",\n      \"title\": \"Neuromodulation targets pathological not physiological beta bursts during gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"区分正常行走时的生理性beta活动和病理性beta burst，对建立可用于刺激的神经标志物非常重要。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"31494286\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2019.104605\",\n      \"title\": \"Subthalamic nucleus oscillations correlate with vulnerability to freezing of gait in patients with Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"研究FOG易感性而非仅仅实际冻结事件，帮助区分trait marker与episode marker。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"31665229\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awz325\",\n      \"title\": \"Hitting the brakes: pathological subthalamic nucleus activity in Parkinson's disease gait freezing\",\n      \"why\": \"直接研究FOG期间的STN神经活动，是支持STN病理性制动机制的重要原始研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"31505548\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awz141\",\n      \"title\": \"Freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease reflects a sudden derangement of locomotor network dynamics\",\n      \"why\": \"非常重要的竞争性证据：强调FOG发生时的运动网络动力学和皮质-STN耦合异常，而非简单的STN beta功率升高。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"37226972\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1002/mds.29455\",\n      \"title\": \"Subthalamic Nucleus Activity during Cognitive Load and Gait Dysfunction in Parkinson's Disease\",\n      \"why\": \"研究认知负荷和步态异常下的STN活动，特别适合与其他报告theta升高的研究比较。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"39470410\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awae223\",\n      \"title\": \"Supraspinal contributions to defective antagonistic inhibition and freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"研究上位运动网络、STN活动和拮抗肌抑制异常，为非单纯STN局部beta机制提供直接证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"36070366\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1126/scitranslmed.abo1800\",\n      \"title\": \"Principles of gait encoding in the subthalamic nucleus of people with Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"STN步态编码的重要研究，帮助区分正常步态相关神经调制与FOG特异性异常。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"35441231\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awac121\",\n      \"title\": \"Cortical phase-amplitude coupling is key to the occurrence and treatment of freezing of gait\",\n      \"why\": \"强调皮质跨频耦合和FOG发生、治疗之间的关系，是皮质-基底节网络机制的重要证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"24142148\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awt272\",\n      \"title\": \"Freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease is associated with functional decoupling between the cognitive control network and the basal ganglia\",\n      \"why\": \"经典功能影像研究，支持认知控制网络与基底节之间的功能解耦机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"38101024\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.parkreldis.2023.105952\",\n      \"title\": \"Subthalamic functional connectivity associated with freezing of gait dopa-response\",\n      \"why\": \"检验STN功能连接是否能解释FOG对多巴胺治疗的不同反应。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"35431262\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.3233/JPD-212997\",\n      \"title\": \"Structural Connectivity of Subthalamic Nucleus Stimulation for Improving Freezing of Gait in Parkinson's Disease\",\n      \"why\": \"直接研究STN刺激的结构连接与FOG疗效，检验纤维束募集和电极位置假说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"18420482\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1212/01.wnl.0000303972.16279.46\",\n      \"title\": \"STN-DBS frequency effects on freezing of gait in advanced Parkinson disease\",\n      \"why\": \"低频与高频STN-DBS研究的早期关键证据，构建刺激频率争议的历史起点。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"24165197\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1111/ner.12131\",\n      \"title\": \"60-Hz frequency effect on gait in Parkinson's disease with subthalamic nucleus deep brain stimulation\",\n      \"why\": \"低频刺激疗效的反向证据之一，用于比较不同患者群体和实验设计下的频率效果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"25540305\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1212/WNL.0000000000001184\",\n      \"title\": \"Low-frequency stimulation of the subthalamic nucleus reduces aspiration and freezing of gait in patients with Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"支持低频STN刺激改善FOG的临床研究，是与60 Hz无效研究比较的核心文献。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"28529730\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1186/s40035-017-0083-7\",\n      \"title\": \"Effect of low versus high frequency stimulation on freezing of gait and other axial symptoms in Parkinson patients with bilateral STN DBS: a mini-review\",\n      \"why\": \"专门讨论低频与高频刺激的差异及研究异质性，适合整理频率争议的来源。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"27766724\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1111/ene.13167\",\n      \"title\": \"Effect of high-frequency subthalamic neurostimulation on gait and freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease: a systematic review and meta-analysis\",\n      \"why\": \"低频与高频刺激争议的重要早期定量综合。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"38948151\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/nsr/nwae187\",\n      \"title\": \"Variable frequency deep brain stimulation of subthalamic nucleus to improve freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"研究可变频STN刺激，为传统固定频率之外的干预机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"39223361\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1007/s10143-024-02761-x\",\n      \"title\": \"Efficacy of subthalamic deep brain stimulation programming strategies for gait disorders in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"系统比较STN-DBS不同编程策略与步态结局，帮助识别参数、研究设计和临床终点造成的异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"39475137\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1002/ana.27099\",\n      \"title\": \"Directional Subthalamic Deep Brain Stimulation Better Improves Gait and Balance Disorders in Parkinson's Disease Patients\",\n      \"why\": \"方向性刺激和空间定位证据，可用于判断刺激疗效是否取决于STN内不同区域及邻近纤维募集。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"40709562\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1002/ana.70003\",\n      \"title\": \"Subthalamic Electrophysiological Mapping of Gait Initiation Dynamics and Freezing in Parkinson's Disease\",\n      \"why\": \"较新的STN电生理空间映射研究，重点关注步态启动与冻结的局部神经活动差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"39884164\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.clinph.2025.01.005\",\n      \"title\": \"Alpha and high beta subthalamic intermittent activity correlates with freezing of gait severity in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"较新的STN间歇性alpha和高beta活动研究，有助于检查FOG严重程度与平均功率指标是否存在差别。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"40677701\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/braincomms/fcaf266\",\n      \"title\": \"Beta burst-driven adaptive deep brain stimulation for Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"检验beta burst能否成为自适应刺激的控制变量，特别需要关注其对FOG而非一般运动症状的实际效果。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"40072634\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1007/s00415-025-13000-8\",\n      \"title\": \"Could adaptive deep brain stimulation treat freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease?\",\n      \"why\": \"自适应DBS与FOG的专题综述，适合建立实时预测、刺激触发和个体化治疗的证据框架。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41531-025-01173-y\",\n      \"title\": \"Neural signatures of turn-induced freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease: insights from phase-specific cortico-subthalamic dynamics\",\n      \"why\": \"同时记录皮质ECoG、STN-LFP和运动学数据，区分转弯不同阶段的神经变化及药物影响，是直接检验网络协调假说的重要研究。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"40926219\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1186/s12984-025-01712-x\",\n      \"title\": \"Nigral stimulation for freezing of gait: kinematic gait parameters inform optimization of stimulation frequency\",\n      \"why\": \"随机交叉设计结合可穿戴步态运动学，研究STN与SNr双靶点刺激和频率个体化，适合检验脑干输出通路机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"40092840\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1136/bmjno-2024-000898\",\n      \"title\": \"Gait and balance worsening after bilateral deep brain stimulation of the subthalamic nucleus (STN-DBS) for Parkinson's disease: a systematic review\",\n      \"why\": \"系统总结STN-DBS后步态和冻结恶化的负面证据，尤其值得检查电流扩散和邻近步态通路募集假说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42236313\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1111/ejn.70570\",\n      \"title\": \"Cognitive and Emotional Determinants of Subthalamic Oscillations During Freezing While Turning in Parkinson's Disease\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年直接研究FOG转弯期间STN theta与焦虑、认知表现的关系，是检验认知-情绪调节机制的重要新证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42571859\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1016/j.nbd.2026.107571\",\n      \"title\": \"Gait-cycle-locked cortico-subthalamic signatures underlying freezing of gait and their modulation in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年重要研究，以步态周期而非固定时间窗口分析皮质-STN活动，并比较高频、低频刺激和左旋多巴的作用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42239677\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.3389/fneur.2026.1793291\",\n      \"title\": \"An initial machine learning model applied to local field potential data from the subthalamic nucleus to detect freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"直接测试STN-LFP预测实际FOG的可行性；样本仅5人、8次试验，应作为初步预测证据而非已验证的通用生物标志物。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42098512\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1007/s10143-026-04312-y\",\n      \"title\": \"Deep brain stimulation for freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease: An updated systematic review, meta-analysis, and a single-center clinical experience\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年更新的FOG-DBS系统综述和荟萃分析，应作为当前临床疗效证据的重要基准。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"41659700\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"Effects of different types of deep brain stimulation on gait disorders in patients with Parkinson's disease: a network meta-analysis of randomized controlled trials\",\n      \"why\": \"另一项2026年网络荟萃分析，其FOG-Q结局与部分积极的DBS综述结论存在差异，必须比较纳入研究、结局定义和统计模型。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42909654\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1007/s10072-026-09479-2\",\n      \"title\": \"STN-SNr co-stimulation in Parkinson's disease: a systematic review and meta-analysis of motor and freezing-of-gait outcomes\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年双靶点刺激荟萃分析；未发现明确的额外FOG获益，且证据质量和异质性值得重点审查。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42860886\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1002/mdc3.70813\",\n      \"title\": \"Disease Duration Differentiates Freezing of Gait Response to Subthalamic and Nigral Stimulation for Parkinson's Disease in an Exploratory Multicenter Controlled Trial\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年多中心随机对照探索性研究，比较STN与STN+SNr，发现总体结局没有显著差异但存在潜在疾病阶段相关的响应者差异。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"41388789\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awaf464\",\n      \"title\": \"Dopamine and the dynamics of subthalamic and leg muscle activities in parkinsonian stepping\",\n      \"why\": \"同时记录STN-LFP和下肢EMG，研究不同beta频段、步态相位和左旋多巴的作用。虽然不是FOG发作研究，但对区分生理性步态beta与病理性beta非常重要。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"42522567\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1093/brain/awag259\",\n      \"title\": \"Distinct roles of the human cuneiform and pedunculopontine nuclei in gait and freezing of gait\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年脑干步态网络研究，帮助判断FOG是否涉及PPN、cuneiform nucleus等STN下游或相邻结构。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"28119584\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.3389/fnhum.2016.00649\",\n      \"title\": \"A neurocomputational model of freezing of gait in Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"直接针对FOG的计算模型，适合检查认知负荷、基底节竞争机制及步态控制模型能否产生可检验预测。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"37932548\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41591-023-02584-1\",\n      \"title\": \"A spinal cord neuroprosthesis for locomotor deficits due to Parkinson's disease\",\n      \"why\": \"非人灵长类与人体转化研究，展示脊髓运动网络对步态和FOG的贡献；虽然不是STN活动研究，但可帮助检验脑干-脊髓最终共同通路机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pmid\": \"41857020\",\n      \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41531-026-01304-z\",\n      \"title\": \"Cortical and basal ganglia beta oscillations and frequency-dependent DBS effects in the A53T Parkinson's disease rat model\",\n      \"why\": \"2026年α-synuclein动物模型，包含STN单神经元、LFP和频率依赖性刺激证据。需要特别注意该模型并非已经验证的FOG模型，不能将一般运动障碍直接等同于FOG。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cce26b3e-4ed1-41fe-9448-2eae24978c5a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T064600965003Z", "elapsed_seconds": 1614.922, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T07:12:55.891618+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "417957f9f4beb50547cd14ccc80bf1973724c184db865c83abddc1677f131153", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachm